WEBVTT

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:12.120
This is a thick fog.

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:13.920
Ghosts might appear.

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:16.430
Never say such a thing.

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:20.660
When you say it, it might happen.
Especially on a night like this.

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:23.330
You're kidding, right?

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:30.800
It can't be!

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.690
What was that ship?

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:52.170
A ghost ship.

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:56.130
I don't believe it. No way.

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:03.310
It was a Japanese boat.

00:01:03.510 --> 00:01:05.880
Japan. Are we nearby?

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:09.020
Seems to be. What is it?

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:12.090
It's where our long lost friend is.

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:18.060
But I'm sure he has long forgotten us.

00:01:18.430 --> 00:01:22.620
You mean me, and the days we shared?

00:01:22.930 --> 00:01:25.370
Lilith, shouldn't we...

00:01:25.570 --> 00:01:29.030
...set our feet on
land once in a while?

00:01:29.240 --> 00:01:33.940
Forget him. Forget the one
who betrayed us, the Shinmas.

00:01:34.140 --> 00:01:35.970
You think it's too impulsive?

00:01:36.410 --> 00:01:40.940
If I thought you were too impulsive,
I wouldn't be here now.

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:43.410
Then it's decided.

00:01:43.990 --> 00:01:47.390
Steer the ship to Japan!

00:01:56.530 --> 00:01:58.520
What's wrong, Larva?

00:01:58.730 --> 00:02:00.130
Did you hear that?

00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:01.360
What?

00:02:01.870 --> 00:02:04.810
No, nothing.

00:02:43.010 --> 00:02:48.640
Shinma are supernatural beings
that devour the hearts of men...

00:02:48.850 --> 00:02:53.080
...and lead them to ruin.

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:59.090
Long ago, they were sealed
in the Dark World.

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:03.500
However, there are stray Shinma
that live secretly...

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:06.630
...in the human world.

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:10.490
They lurk in the division
between night and day.

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:17.140
The Guardian who sends the stray
Shinma back to the Dark World...

00:03:17.350 --> 00:03:22.840
...is the beautiful vampire, Miyu.

00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:27.010
No one knows her true face.

00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:58.550
SHINMA
RYU

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:02.180
Flame!

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:10.230
You must be very confident
to initiate an attack.

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:13.930
But I wonder if
you can win in my territory.

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:16.900
I hate the Guardian!

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:18.430
Larva!

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:29.780
This is the Death Crystal!

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:37.350
Go!

00:04:48.440 --> 00:04:51.410
He got away from me.

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:57.740
Miyu, are you all right?

00:04:57.950 --> 00:05:00.880
Fine. We have to chase that Shinma.

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:03.610
It's better to forget about him.

00:05:04.190 --> 00:05:05.620
Why?

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:10.050
If we leave a powerful Shinma out
there, we don't know what he'll do.

00:05:10.490 --> 00:05:13.950
In any case, let's withdraw for now.

00:05:14.760 --> 00:05:17.630
All right. Let's go home.

00:05:42.520 --> 00:05:45.190
- Man, this hurts.
- Hey, you.

00:05:45.790 --> 00:05:48.160
What's the matter? Are you okay?

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:52.600
Hey, hang in there.

00:06:02.110 --> 00:06:03.630
Where...?

00:06:04.010 --> 00:06:06.480
Don't. You can't get up yet.

00:06:10.920 --> 00:06:14.320
I can't bother you.
If I stay here...

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:17.420
- Because you're a Shinma?
- How...?

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:20.790
You're insensitive
because you're one of us.

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:22.520
Then you are...

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:27.630
Right. A stray Shinma.
Here, don't worry.

00:06:29.100 --> 00:06:32.600
You're severely wounded.
Is that your true form?

00:06:32.810 --> 00:06:35.170
No, this is just...

00:06:36.610 --> 00:06:41.070
Do you ever wonder
why we were born this way?

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:46.790
It's not like Larva
to fail to catch a Shinma.

00:06:46.990 --> 00:06:49.620
I wonder if there's something wrong.

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:55.060
- Larva, you're hiding something.
- No, I'm...

00:06:55.660 --> 00:07:00.100
You think I wouldn't notice?
We have been together forever.

00:07:01.670 --> 00:07:03.000
The Light of the Sea.

00:07:04.510 --> 00:07:07.340
The Light of the Sea is calling me.

00:07:07.540 --> 00:07:10.640
It is a demonic light
that captures your heart.

00:07:10.850 --> 00:07:13.340
I must break the spell.

00:07:13.550 --> 00:07:16.920
No. Aren't you supposed
to be with me all the time?

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:19.920
Miyu, you can't come with me.

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:22.450
That's what they want.

00:07:22.660 --> 00:07:26.530
No matter how inviting it is,
you should not leave here.

00:07:26.730 --> 00:07:28.630
You are a Guardian.

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:33.400
I won't let you deal
with it alone, because...

00:07:36.840 --> 00:07:40.670
You defeated me.
What more do you want me to do?

00:07:41.110 --> 00:07:45.880
Nothing. But I want you
to hold on to my life.

00:07:46.550 --> 00:07:48.280
Your life?

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:53.690
If or when I want to break away
from this circle of destiny...

00:07:53.890 --> 00:07:56.950
...I want you to break it off for me.

00:07:57.160 --> 00:07:58.520
I promise.

00:07:58.890 --> 00:08:03.520
I will follow you as long as you wish.

00:08:08.140 --> 00:08:11.400
You haven't forgotten
your promise, have you?

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:16.670
I shall return, Miyu, when
the Light of the Sea goes out.

00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:20.050
But wait, Larva...

00:08:28.990 --> 00:08:30.360
Larva...

00:08:30.790 --> 00:08:35.520
What was the promise?
Where did Larva go?

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:47.430
You can eat human food, can't you?

00:08:47.640 --> 00:08:49.440
Yeah. What about you?

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:54.410
I don't need it.
I absorb human energy.

00:08:54.820 --> 00:08:56.080
Then you are...

00:08:56.720 --> 00:09:01.780
I'm not gonna kill you.
Can't you tell what I do for a living?

00:09:02.320 --> 00:09:04.760
You mean, with men...

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:06.260
That's right.

00:09:06.460 --> 00:09:11.020
My customers have too much energy.
No one cares if I take some.

00:09:11.870 --> 00:09:16.460
They like leaving exhausted.
I consider it mutually beneficial.

00:09:16.670 --> 00:09:20.900
That's how I live without being
discovered by Guardians.

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:24.900
All the more reason why you
shouldn't be taking care of me.

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:29.650
Calm down. You're new
to this town, aren't you?

00:09:30.850 --> 00:09:33.680
There are many Shinmas
like me in this town.

00:09:33.890 --> 00:09:36.120
I heard Guardians are quite fickle.

00:09:36.330 --> 00:09:39.330
They do not penalize everyone
like tax collectors.

00:09:39.860 --> 00:09:44.320
But I came from a village up north...

00:09:44.530 --> 00:09:46.160
...to fight her.

00:09:46.370 --> 00:09:50.600
- You've never killed a human, have you?
- How did you know?

00:09:51.010 --> 00:09:54.370
It's easy to tell
because I haven't either.

00:09:54.580 --> 00:09:57.340
Did you come here
to fight the Guardian?

00:09:57.550 --> 00:10:00.910
I don't know. I don't know!
I have no idea!

00:10:14.400 --> 00:10:16.960
Larva didn't come back today either.

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:19.940
Light of the Sea...
The sea!

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:24.860
- That's what he meant by "they."
- What's wrong?

00:10:25.610 --> 00:10:30.040
I shouldn't have let him go alone.
I have to catch up with him.

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:32.950
Are you taking time off from work?

00:10:36.890 --> 00:10:39.290
Reiha, don't get in my way.

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:42.820
Don't you have something
to do before you go?

00:10:43.130 --> 00:10:45.730
The Shinma you failed to catch.

00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:48.690
Or rather, your servant.
You cornered him.

00:10:48.900 --> 00:10:51.690
Don't tell me
you're not gonna finish him.

00:10:52.400 --> 00:10:54.130
Has he done something?

00:10:54.870 --> 00:10:56.630
Nothing yet.

00:10:56.840 --> 00:11:01.000
But if you leave him unleashed,
we don't know what he'll do.

00:11:01.410 --> 00:11:06.710
Your servant betrayed you. It was
bound to happen with a Western Shinma.

00:11:06.920 --> 00:11:11.490
If you have time to chase after him,
you should fulfill your duty first.

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:13.850
Like it or not, you are a Guardian.

00:11:14.490 --> 00:11:19.390
Don't forget it.
We are being tolerant.

00:11:21.760 --> 00:11:23.460
In the name of the Guardians...

00:11:23.670 --> 00:11:28.300
...I will not let a Western Shinma
have his way here in Japan.

00:11:28.840 --> 00:11:30.330
A Guardian?

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:35.740
Then if I defeat you, the Japanese
Shinma world will be mine.

00:11:35.940 --> 00:11:37.880
I won't be easy on you!

00:11:40.020 --> 00:11:43.590
Since you're so persistent,
I assume you know where he is.

00:11:44.150 --> 00:11:47.050
Yes. We'll lead the way.

00:11:51.030 --> 00:11:52.390
I'm home.

00:11:56.500 --> 00:12:00.730
You must be hungry.
I'm sorry this isn't more appealing.

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:04.200
Nami, I'm thinking
about going back north.

00:12:05.070 --> 00:12:06.160
Yeah?

00:12:06.370 --> 00:12:10.370
I have no idea why I came here...

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:14.950
...or why I hated the Guardian,
so I'm going back to find answers.

00:12:15.150 --> 00:12:17.380
It's probably for the best.

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:19.950
You took such good care of me.

00:12:20.160 --> 00:12:25.260
Don't mention it. Ryu, is your
village up north a nice place?

00:12:25.760 --> 00:12:30.220
It suited me. I didn't get
involved with the villagers.

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:32.490
I was sleeping one night...

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:36.000
...and the next thing I knew,
I had to come here.

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:39.800
This thing in my shoulder
is making me fight.

00:12:40.010 --> 00:12:45.780
It's not my wish. It's not the kind
of thing that's normally inside me.

00:12:47.080 --> 00:12:50.610
- I'll come with you.
- What?

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:54.690
I want to help you solve your mystery.

00:12:54.890 --> 00:12:59.290
I'm just living. I don't have
anything to lose or protect.

00:12:59.760 --> 00:13:02.420
So, is it okay with you?

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:03.930
Nami...

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:08.830
- What's wrong, Ryu?
- A Guardian is coming.

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:12.630
It'll be all right. Leave it to me.

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:21.750
- Hang in there until a taxi comes.
- Okay.

00:13:21.950 --> 00:13:27.050
Escaping? You think that if you
don't attack, we won't notice you?

00:13:27.420 --> 00:13:30.750
Sneaking away is something
stray Shinmas would do.

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:36.260
You can't stay in the human world.
Give up and go back to the darkness.

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:40.230
Miyu, let us witness your skills.

00:13:44.410 --> 00:13:46.030
You are the Guardian?

00:13:46.240 --> 00:13:51.340
Yes. It's my duty to return
stray Shinmas to the darkness.

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:53.940
Please let us go.

00:13:54.150 --> 00:13:59.110
He said he won't fight you anymore.
He has a hometown to go back to.

00:13:59.720 --> 00:14:03.120
He will not bother humans or you.

00:14:03.330 --> 00:14:07.070
He just wants to live
quietly in his own home.

00:14:08.030 --> 00:14:10.090
I have my own destiny.

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:13.190
Then there's nothing we can do.

00:14:13.400 --> 00:14:17.770
Nami, you should run away.
I'll fight and that's enough.

00:14:17.970 --> 00:14:20.810
No, we are not alone anymore.

00:14:23.480 --> 00:14:24.470
Nami.

00:14:26.410 --> 00:14:29.040
SHINMA
NAMI

00:14:37.760 --> 00:14:39.350
Is that your power?

00:14:39.860 --> 00:14:42.850
That's right. Putting up
a barrier. That's it.

00:14:43.060 --> 00:14:46.330
But my wishes come true
inside the barrier.

00:14:46.770 --> 00:14:50.860
I can't tell
if it is effective or not.

00:14:51.070 --> 00:14:55.340
Miyu, finish her off. You can blow
away this barrier, can't you?

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:56.900
Keep quiet.

00:15:02.650 --> 00:15:03.880
Is that so?

00:15:05.020 --> 00:15:06.380
Flame!

00:15:09.190 --> 00:15:10.590
Go!

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:15.660
- Let me help you.
- Don't bother.

00:15:16.030 --> 00:15:17.500
Blizzard.

00:15:20.600 --> 00:15:22.690
Not too bad.

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:27.160
This gives me chills.
Some challenges are good.

00:15:27.380 --> 00:15:31.620
You can't hurt us
while we are in this barrier.

00:15:31.810 --> 00:15:37.250
But you can't defeat us either.
Are you going to wait forever?

00:15:37.820 --> 00:15:41.450
I will make you wait
until you allow Ryu to return.

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:43.950
How sweet.

00:15:44.160 --> 00:15:47.560
I almost want to cry.
They're helping each other.

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:50.100
Do you want us to join you?

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:54.170
We'll increase your fire force
with our blizzard.

00:15:54.370 --> 00:15:57.270
Don't worry.
We won't take all the credit.

00:15:58.070 --> 00:15:59.230
Why?

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:03.410
Why do I have to fight?

00:16:03.910 --> 00:16:05.740
It's your duty.

00:16:06.010 --> 00:16:08.710
Are you going
to resign as a Guardian?

00:16:08.920 --> 00:16:13.080
Then you'll only be a vampire.
We'll be enemies tomorrow.

00:16:17.230 --> 00:16:20.360
Why does a little vampire girl
want to fight me?

00:16:20.560 --> 00:16:24.220
If you remain quiet,
I won't mind letting you go.

00:16:24.430 --> 00:16:26.660
Because it's my destiny.

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:29.900
Then your destiny will
be over shortly!

00:16:31.570 --> 00:16:34.100
Okay. Reiha, are you ready?

00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:36.810
Anytime you wish.

00:16:40.880 --> 00:16:43.480
Wait! Something is wrong.

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:47.550
Nami!

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:51.210
What are you doing?

00:16:51.430 --> 00:16:54.420
They're getting weak.
This is the best chance.

00:16:56.030 --> 00:16:58.360
Are you all right, Nami?

00:17:02.140 --> 00:17:06.800
What good timing.
Do you want me to finish them off?

00:17:07.480 --> 00:17:12.650
Is your pride so pitiful that you need
to beat up someone weak on the ground?

00:17:14.480 --> 00:17:18.440
That's unpleasant. Is this
your way of avoiding your duty?

00:17:18.650 --> 00:17:20.050
What are you doing?

00:17:24.030 --> 00:17:26.130
It's just like yours.

00:17:26.330 --> 00:17:31.290
I can't believe it. She got it from
me, because she touched my wound.

00:17:31.500 --> 00:17:32.760
What is it?

00:17:32.970 --> 00:17:34.870
Even I don't know.

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:36.400
Shiina, do you know?

00:17:36.970 --> 00:17:41.000
It reeks of demonic spirit,
but I've never seen it.

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:43.970
It's the Death Crystal.

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:50.070
It deteriorates the Shinmas' health,
ultimately causing death.

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:54.420
I thought the Death Crystal was
a spell used by Western Shinmas.

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:58.190
Are you a tool of Western Shinmas?
Where are they?

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:03.360
I don't know. I don't remember.

00:18:03.570 --> 00:18:07.240
- Where did you come from?
- A little village up north.

00:18:17.580 --> 00:18:20.780
Japan, it's a poor country.

00:18:20.980 --> 00:18:23.450
It's too poor for me to take over.

00:18:23.650 --> 00:18:25.620
Don't be so quick to judge.

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:29.760
Welcome, Western Shinma.

00:18:29.960 --> 00:18:33.090
But I will not let you
go any further.

00:18:33.760 --> 00:18:36.750
What a brat you are.
A Japanese Shinma?

00:18:37.270 --> 00:18:38.940
I'm the Guardian.

00:18:43.440 --> 00:18:45.870
That's the place.
Larva must be there.

00:18:46.570 --> 00:18:48.040
I don't know.

00:18:48.240 --> 00:18:50.800
What's going on? Could you explain?

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:54.510
It means we don't have time to fight.

00:18:54.720 --> 00:18:57.550
Western Shinmas are trying
to land in Japan.

00:18:58.120 --> 00:19:02.490
- That's a problem.
- I guess it's a temporary cease-fire.

00:19:03.060 --> 00:19:06.920
You'll take us there, won't you?
With that Shinma.

00:19:07.130 --> 00:19:11.660
If we don't capture the Western
Shinmas, you'll eventually die.

00:19:11.870 --> 00:19:14.430
That's not what you want, is it?

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:15.930
All right.

00:19:24.010 --> 00:19:27.070
How ironic this is,
coming back here.

00:19:34.620 --> 00:19:35.610
You!

00:19:37.730 --> 00:19:40.360
WESTERN SHINMA
BARROW

00:19:40.830 --> 00:19:44.990
If you are here,
it means Garline is here also.

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:49.830
You're right, honorable Larva.
I will take you to him.

00:19:50.510 --> 00:19:52.610
I am no longer who I was before.

00:19:52.810 --> 00:19:56.300
Go back to Garline and tell him
that his friend has died.

00:19:56.540 --> 00:19:59.030
Then I will force you to go to him.

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:01.010
Go ahead.

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:18.050
You shall go back to your sea.

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:33.270
Lilith?

00:20:36.820 --> 00:20:39.810
Honorable Larva. It's been so long.

00:20:40.020 --> 00:20:42.680
WESTERN SHINMA
LILITH

00:20:43.160 --> 00:20:45.020
You are here too?

00:20:45.560 --> 00:20:49.430
Do you remember the sound of my flute?

00:20:49.630 --> 00:20:53.000
Why did you come here?
To take me back?

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:56.860
Honorable Garline was acting
on a whim.

00:20:57.070 --> 00:20:59.940
But I also wanted to see you again.

00:21:00.410 --> 00:21:03.400
Weren't you listening?
I'm no longer...

00:21:03.610 --> 00:21:08.570
Yes. But I want you
to remember your home place.

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:19.760
I shall not return. I am now...

00:21:31.840 --> 00:21:35.040
Honorable Garline will be delighted.

00:21:38.580 --> 00:21:41.910
Larva, my dearest friend.

00:21:42.820 --> 00:21:47.880
Let us leave this deserted island
and venture out to the sea.

00:21:48.090 --> 00:21:50.680
WESTERN SHINMA
GARLINE

00:21:51.260 --> 00:21:54.390
Then we will reminisce
about our good old home.

00:21:54.600 --> 00:21:58.470
We won't even notice
how much time has passed.

00:22:12.650 --> 00:22:18.680
The door opens
And before me is eternity

00:22:18.890 --> 00:22:21.220
Whose voice calls me...

00:22:21.420 --> 00:22:25.360
...from so far away?

00:22:25.560 --> 00:22:28.190
Someone smoothes down my hair

00:22:28.400 --> 00:22:32.460
Who are you?

00:22:35.140 --> 00:22:39.130
My flute sings of a land
My heart so wishes for

00:22:39.340 --> 00:22:43.970
Where time and my feelings pass by

00:22:44.180 --> 00:22:48.440
- I don't want any friends
- That's a lie.

00:22:48.650 --> 00:22:52.910
- I don't even need myself
- It's the truth.

00:22:53.120 --> 00:22:57.110
Footprints I leave behind

00:22:57.330 --> 00:23:01.600
Washed away

00:23:04.300 --> 00:23:08.390
The night is mysterious
It conceals the truth

00:23:08.600 --> 00:23:12.830
Invited by the moon

00:23:13.040 --> 00:23:16.770
Darkness spreads through the sky

00:23:19.410 --> 00:23:25.940
The night is violet
Tears fall like rain

00:23:26.190 --> 00:23:33.120
The sky cries for me

00:23:40.300 --> 00:23:46.330
The door opens
And before me is eternity

00:23:46.540 --> 00:23:48.870
Whose voice calls me...

00:23:49.080 --> 00:23:53.010
...from so far away?

00:23:53.210 --> 00:23:55.840
Someone smoothes down my hair

00:23:56.050 --> 00:24:00.110
Who are you?

00:24:02.790 --> 00:24:06.780
My flute sings of a land
My heart so wishes for

00:24:06.990 --> 00:24:11.620
Where time and my feelings pass by

00:24:11.830 --> 00:24:16.100
- I don't want any friends
- That's a lie.

00:24:16.300 --> 00:24:20.570
- I don't even need myself
- It's the truth.

00:24:20.780 --> 00:24:24.780
Footprints I leave behind

00:24:24.980 --> 00:24:29.240
Washed away

00:24:31.950 --> 00:24:36.050
The night is mysterious
It conceals the truth

00:24:36.260 --> 00:24:40.490
Invited by the moon

00:24:40.700 --> 00:24:44.440
Darkness spreads through the sky

00:24:47.070 --> 00:24:53.600
The night is violet
Tears fall like rain

00:24:53.840 --> 00:25:00.770
The sky cries for me

00:25:06.050 --> 00:25:09.750
A Western Shinma, Garline,
tempts Larva to the dark side.

00:25:09.960 --> 00:25:12.390
The Death Crystal gets in my way.

00:25:12.690 --> 00:25:14.960
But I will not be defeated...

00:25:15.160 --> 00:25:18.360
...because there are blood ties
between me and Larva.

00:25:19.500 --> 00:25:23.460
The battle in the northern ocean
is no longer just for me.

00:25:23.840 --> 00:25:28.430
Next on Vampire Princess Miyu,
"Light of the Sea, Part 2."

00:25:28.640 --> 00:25:31.240
Larva, you must remember!
